The object storage adapter, the Drive module and the import message hints
(src/lib/import/message-hints-utils.ts) are derived from Mailflare commits 83ade98,
9f66e13, 3c90a03 and 4aaf066 by Hieu Nguyen (AGPL-3.0).

The sender authentication policy (src/lib/spam/engine.ts, src/lib/spam/dmarc-policy-utils.ts) and
the SMTP listener's limits and SPF/DKIM/DMARC checks (server/runtime/smtp*.ts) are adapted from
Mailflare commits 43d656a, c824aeb, ec8cb0d and 36b3bed by Hieu Nguyen (AGPL-3.0).

